'''Gingerheart''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife which was originally obtained by purchasing the 9th tier of the [[Christmas Event 2024]].

== Appearance ==
Gingerheart has a brown base color, adorned with white patterns that resemble icing and candies stuck onto it to resemble a gingerbread treat.

== Trivia ==

* It has lately been partnered with the ancient gun [[Gingerscope]] mainly because [[Gingerscythe]] is untradeable.

